# Workflow testing harness: keep README + tools/; ignore dated run outputs and other ad-hoc dirs
workflows/testing/*
!workflows/testing/README.md
!workflows/testing/tools/
!workflows/testing/tools/**
workflows/testing/tools/**/__pycache__/
workflows/testing/tools/**/__pycache__/**